# The block-list spelling of depends_on gates exactly as the inline one does,
# and the owns and acceptance blocks after it are not read as dependencies.
run available
exit 0
file tasks/M1-01.md
	---
	id: M1-01
	depends_on: []
	exclusive: no
	---
file tasks/M2-01.md
	---
	id: M2-01
	depends_on:
	  - M1-01
	exclusive: no
	owns:
	  - crates/analyze/
	  - Cargo.toml
	acceptance:
	  - the workspace still compiles
	---
stdout
	M1-01
